{"key": "role-state:autocomplete-valid:08fc2d04ed29", "issueId": null, "source": "scanner", "outcome": "drop", "severityBefore": "medium", "severityAfter": "medium", "reason": "The Industry combobox has autocomplete=\"garbage\", an invalid token, but it asks for the company industry from a list of five options, a purpose that is not among the 53 input purposes of 1.3.5. The token is a way to stop browser autofill on a field that has its own list, and it changes nothing in the accessibility tree.", "reasonCode": "not-aa-failure", "counterEvidence": "probe-2fe21237d198", "probes": [{"build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "env": {"colorScheme": "light", "dpr": 1, "reducedMotion": "reduce", "viewport": [1440, 900]}, "id": "probe-2fe21237d198", "kind": "ax", "pass": null, "state": "home.customize-demo-modal", "value": {"description": "", "ignored": false, "name": "Industry", "role": "combobox", "states": {"expanded": false, "haspopup": "listbox"}, "template": "combobox \"Industry\" [expanded=false, haspopup=listbox]"}, "xpath": "/html/body/div[15]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/form[1]/div[1]/div[6]/div[1]/div[1]/input[1]"}, {"build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "env": {"colorScheme": "light", "dpr": 1, "reducedMotion": "reduce", "viewport": [1440, 900]}, "id": "probe-0ff7ea058eba", "kind": "ax", "pass": null, "state": "home.customize-demo-invalid", "value": {"description": "", "ignored": false, "name": "Industry", "role": "combobox", "states": {"errormessage": "Please complete this field", "expanded": false, "haspopup": "listbox", "invalid": true}, "template": "combobox \"Industry\" [expanded=false, haspopup=listbox, invalid=true, errormessage=Please complete this field]"}, "xpath": "/html/body/div[15]/div[1]/div[1]/div[1]/form[1]/div[1]/div[6]/div[1]/div[1]/input[1]"}], "states": ["home.customize-demo-modal", "home.customize-demo-invalid"], "build": "0c71cd6c04c156c7db9581351966063c95f0a701", "model": "sonnet", "batch": "second-025", "prompt": "verifier@3", "attempt": 1, "second": true, "date": "2026-10-03", "criterionAnalysis": "1.3.5 Identify Input Purpose applies only to fields that collect information about the user and whose purpose is one of the 53 input purposes (name, email, organization, address and so on). The Industry combobox collects a company industry from a fixed list, which is not one of them, so the criterion does not apply and the invalid token cannot fail it. 4.1.2 is not affected: the combobox has the name Industry, expanded and haspopup states. No other A or AA criterion covers an autocomplete token."}
